{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTaBKUso8RhBNpPU58f9Pg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# ADR 0009: Move the background workers back into their own repository\n2\t\n3\tDate: 2026-02-10\n4\tStatus: Accepted · supersedes ADR 0004\n5\t\n6\t## Context\n7\t\n8\tThe workers team ships on a different cadence and their Python toolchain doubled the monorepo's CI time. Shared types are now published as a versioned package, which removes the drift problem ADR 0004 solved.\n9\t\n10\t## Decision\n11\t\n12\tThe workers move to `platform/workers`. Shared types are consumed from the published `@acme/types` package pinned by minor version.\n13\t\n14\t## Consequences\n15\t\n16\t- Positive: monorepo CI drops from 18 to 7 minutes.\n17\t- Negative: a type change needs a package release before workers can use it.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d4ba66c-11ab-407d-bf66-acc277e1e58f","uuid":"30e106b2-470a-4618-8659-31e4aabd4982","timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:58:00.000Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jcarr/.cache/markdownattractor/bench/t6/golden/graphify/src/adr/0009-split-workers-repo.md","content":"# ADR 0009: Move the background workers back into their own repository\n\nDate: 2026-02-10\nStatus: Accepted · supersedes ADR 0004\n\n## Context\n\nThe workers team ships on a different cadence and their Python toolchain doubled the monorepo's CI time. Shared types are now published as a versioned package, which removes the drift problem ADR 0004 solved.\n\n## Decision\n\nThe workers move to `platform/workers`. Shared types are consumed from the published `@acme/types` package pinned by minor version.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Positive: monorepo CI drops from 18 to 7 minutes.\n- Negative: a type change needs a package release before workers can use it.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XTaBKUso8RhBNpPU58f9Pg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
