{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SPYTpa12UxN6chXaJ6eo6A","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# ADR 0004: One repository for the web, API and workers\n2\t\n3\tDate: 2023-11-02\n4\tStatus: Superseded by ADR 0009\n5\t\n6\t## Context\n7\t\n8\tThree repositories meant three CI pipelines and a release train that took a week to coordinate. Shared types drifted between the API and the web client twice in October 2023.\n9\t\n10\t## Decision\n11\t\n12\tThe web client, the API and the background workers move into one repository with a single CI pipeline and a shared `packages/types` module.\n13\t\n14\t## Consequences\n15\t\n16\t- Positive: one pull request changes a type and both its producers and consumers.\n17\t- Negative: CI runs take 18 minutes end to end; selective builds are a follow-up.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d4ba66c-11ab-407d-bf66-acc277e1e58f","uuid":"8de28aa7-9a77-4690-8a05-b89b0842feae","timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:58:00.177Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jcarr/.cache/markdownattractor/bench/t6/golden/graphify/src/adr/0004-monorepo.md","content":"# ADR 0004: One repository for the web, API and workers\n\nDate: 2023-11-02\nStatus: Superseded by ADR 0009\n\n## Context\n\nThree repositories meant three CI pipelines and a release train that took a week to coordinate. Shared types drifted between the API and the web client twice in October 2023.\n\n## Decision\n\nThe web client, the API and the background workers move into one repository with a single CI pipeline and a shared `packages/types` module.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Positive: one pull request changes a type and both its producers and consumers.\n- Negative: CI runs take 18 minutes end to end; selective builds are a follow-up.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SPYTpa12UxN6chXaJ6eo6A","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
